                                "example_id": "d6f30472-ea3b-4db6-a32c-b05bf7ef0f3d",
                                "sense_id": "a0e28a1e-b6dd-3a0c-84c3-823f79c22342",
                                "text": "In the intellectual there is an attempt to solve this conflict by libidinizing speech, thought and intellect, so that these become instinctual satisfactions within themselves."
